    "summary_one_sentence": "When her baby brother is snatched by crows, Prue McKeel and her classmate Curtis venture into the forbidden Impassable Wilderness to rescue him from a sinister dark force.",
    "summary_short": "After young Mac is abducted by a flock of mysterious birds, his sister Prue McKeel refuses to let him vanish without a fight. Joined by her reluctant classmate Curtis, she plunges beyond Portland's borders into the Impassable Wilderness, an enchanted realm hidden in plain sight. Together, they encounter talking animals, warring factions, and ancient magic as they brave mounting perils. To save Mac, they must navigate a realm on the brink of war while facing down the mysterious dark force leading the avian captors.",
    "summary_long": "Life in suburban Portland takes a terrifying turn for Prue McKeel when a murder of crows swoops down and carries off her infant brother, Mac, into the forbidden Impassable Wilderness. Refusing to tell her parents, Prue sets out on a desperate rescue mission and is unexpectedly joined by her awkward classmate, Curtis Mehlberg. Upon crossing the magical boundary, the children discover Wildwood, an enchanted domain populated by intelligent beasts, heroic bandits, and mystical beings. However, the woodland is far from peaceful, fractured by simmering conflict and old rivalries. Curtis quickly gets separated from Prue and is taken in by the majestic, militaristic animal factions of the woods, while Prue searches for clues to Mac's location. They soon realize that Mac was stolen on the orders of Alexandra, a powerful and ruthless figure who rules the dark heart of the forest. Alexandra plans to use the infant in a dangerous ritual that threatens to disrupt the delicate balance of the entire wilderness. As Prue builds alliances with noble woodland creatures and Curtis learns the true nature of the forces at play, the two friends must unite the forest's disparate inhabitants. Facing betrayal, ancient enchantments, and formidable foes, Prue and Curtis launch a perilous assault against Alexandra's stronghold to save Mac and protect Wildwood.",
    "synopsis": "Wildwood follows the extraordinary journey of Prue McKeel, an ordinary girl forced into an extraordinary world when her baby brother, Mac, is kidnapped by a flock of crows and taken into the Impassable Wilderness—a strange, magical forest on the edge of Portland that no one ever enters. Accompanied by her classmate Curtis, Prue steps beyond the known world into a realm filled with talking animals, warring factions, and deep magic. As the duo navigates the dangerous politics and ancient secrets of the enchanted woods, they must rely on newly formed alliances with loyal woodland inhabitants to face off against Alexandra, a dangerous leader intent on using Mac for her own dark motives.",
